--- TABLE ENGINE ON URL grant alone: ENGINE = URL('http://...') is allowed (URL engine) ---
http-allowed
--- TABLE ENGINE ON URL grant alone: ENGINE = URL('s3://...') is denied (dispatches to S3) ---
s3-engine-denied
--- TABLE ENGINE ON URL grant alone: ENGINE = URL('az://...') is denied (dispatches to AzureBlobStorage) ---
azure-engine-denied
--- ATTACH carrying a full definition is checked like CREATE: URL('file://...') is denied (dispatches to File) ---
attach-file-engine-denied
--- ATTACH carrying a full definition is checked like CREATE: URL('az://...') is denied (dispatches to AzureBlobStorage) ---
attach-azure-engine-denied
--- ATTACH carrying a full definition: URL('http://...') is still allowed (URL engine) ---
attach-http-allowed
--- short ATTACH replays stored metadata and is not re-checked, even for a dispatched engine ---
short-attach-allowed
--- RESTORE carries a fresh definition and is checked like CREATE: URL('file://...') needs the File grant ---
restore-file-engine-denied
restore-rejected-not-created
restore-with-grant-allowed
